# One line ending per file type in the repo, whatever the editor or tool wrote: LF everywhere,
# CRLF for the Windows-only scripts. Binary files are detected (text=auto) or listed.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.ps1 text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.iss text eol=crlf
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.ico binary
*.exr binary
*.hdr binary
